Purpose
Shell Downstream South Africa is a mature market with approximately 600 operational Mobility sites. The Mobility South Africa business has plans to high-grade the network with a balanced approach of optimizing the existing portfolio of sites and growing the network using different investment models. This proposed position will play an important role in this journey.
Accountabilities
Responsible for all investments and portfolio actions of the Company Owned/Leased and Dealer Owned Network for the Western Cape, Northern Cape, parts of the Free State and parts of the Eastern Cape Regions.
Contribute to successful multiyear plan delivery and growth strategy as part of one team within network planning, engineering, real estate, soil and groundwater, and other third parties;
Create detailed regional masterplan of areas as specified in the integrated master plan. This includes researching on demographics, infrastructural changes and development of market area, as part regional master plan; analysis of data of existing network in order to propose optimisation actions, and conducting initial project feasibility analysis for all projects in the detailed masterplan;
